---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { guides } from '../../data/guides';
---
<Base title="Audacity 中文使用教程：安装、录音、剪辑与问题排查" description="按问题查找 Audacity 中文教程。包含 x64 安装、麦克风录音、Windows WASAPI 内录、降噪参数、MP3 导出、M4A 导入失败与录音无声排查。" breadcrumbs={[{name:'使用教程',path:'/guides/'}]}><div class="container"><header class="page-heading"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="当前位置"><a href="/">首页</a> / 使用教程</nav><h1>Audacity 中文使用教程</h1><p class="lead">先看适用版本，再按设置表与操作步骤处理。3.x 和 4.x 的菜单、工程格式与快捷键有差异，文章中会单独说明。</p><div style="margin-top:20px"><label for="guide-search" class="fine">搜索当前 {guides.length} 篇教程</label><br /><input id="guide-search" class="filter-input" type="search" placeholder="录音、电脑声音、MP3、M4A…" aria-describedby="search-status" /></div><p class="fine" id="search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">共 {guides.length} 篇</p></header><div class="guide-rows" id="guide-list">{guides.map(g=><a class="guide-row" data-search={`${g.title} ${g.intro} ${g.category} ${g.answer}`} href={`/guides/${g.slug}/`}><span class="row-category">{g.category}</span><div><h2>{g.title}</h2><p>{g.intro}</p><div class="row-meta">{g.applies} · {g.updated}</div></div><span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>)}</div><p class="empty-search" id="search-empty" hidden>没有找到。换一个关键词，或查看<a class="text-link" href="/faq/">常见问题</a>。</p><div class="section"><div class="callout"><div><h2>不确定问题在哪一步？</h2><p>从波形、设备、文件格式和软件版本开始判断。</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/guides/no-sound/">录音无声排查</a></div></div></div></Base>
<script>
const input = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#guide-search');
input?.addEventListener('input', () => { let count=0; const q=input.value.trim().toLocaleLowerCase(); document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-search]').forEach(row=>{row.hidden=!(row.dataset.search||'').toLocaleLowerCase().includes(q); if(!row.hidden)count++;}); const empty=document.getElementById('search-empty'); if(empty)empty.hidden=count>0; const status=document.getElementById('search-status');if(status)status.textContent=q?`找到 ${count} 篇`:`共 ${count} 篇`; });
</script>
